  "plot": "I-22",
  "person": "cmviu7zqz036a8gz31rm54q7o",
  "title": "",
  "html": "<p>Isabella nee Wilson was born in 1839 in Tyrone Northern Ireland. She Married there on 5/6/1861 to William Mcfeeters. They migrated on the &#8216;Summerlee&#8221; on 3/1/1862. They had 9 children. My descendant is through their 3rd child Andrew Wilson Mcfeeters 1865-1946.</p><p>After Isabella&#8217;s hubby died (he is buried in Beechworth),she moved to Broadford to live with her 7th child Joseph Ramsay Mcfeeters and his wife Mary Ann, who were both salvationist&#8217;s. Joe was the band master for 9 yrs there. They moved to NSW after his mothers death.</p><p><br></p>",
  "author": "",
